<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2016-12-14b.387.5" speakername="Graham Stringer" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/10576" colnum="387" time="16:43:00" url="">
    <p pid="b387.5/1">The hon. Gentleman is being very generous. On the allocation of green-belt land for housing, does he agree that the figure is dependent on an assessment of the pipeline of brownfield sites, which has always been overestimated?</p>
</speech>
